# denylist.example: copy to denylist.local (gitignored) and fill in for real.
#
# One term or extended-regex pattern per line; lines starting with # are
# comments. The pre-commit hook and scripts/leak-audit.sh join these with |
# and grep case-insensitively. List everything that must never appear in
# this public repo: unreleased codenames, private repo names, client names,
# internal paths (your home directory), and live-key shapes.
#
# NEVER commit the real list: a list of secrets is itself a secret.
my-unreleased-codename
my-private-repo-name
my-client-name
sk_live_[A-Za-z0-9]+
